# The title, Help, Settings (the runtime's Options), the lists, and Practice's
# assists and pause menu by pointer and keys.
until 300 =Play
frames 150
expect A moonlit conservatory card table.
save screens-title
click =Help
until 60 Heartfall is a trick-taking card game.
frames 5
expect Learn, H asks for a hint and U undoes
frames 5
save screens-help
key Escape 1
until 60 =Play
frames 10
click =Settings
until 120 Accessibility
frames 20
key F1 2
frames 30
until 60 =Play
frames 10
click =Daily Challenge
until 60 Seven days, one table each.
frames 10
expect Today ·
save screens-daily
click =Back
until 60 =Play
frames 10
click =Play
until 60 Modes
frames 10
click =Challenge
until 60 Six tables, each with its own rules
frames 10
expect Moon Marathon
key Escape 1
until 60 Modes
frames 10
click =Practice
until 60 Three tables.
frames 10
click =Casual
until 120 Pass 0/3
frames 10
click =Hint
frames 5
until 30 Pass 3/3
frames 5
save screens-hint
click =Pass 3/3
frames 5
until 60 Pass 3 cards to the left.
frames 5
key KeyU 1
frames 5
until 30 Pass 0/3
frames 10
key Escape 1
until 30 Paused
frames 10
save screens-paused
click =Resume
frames 10
key Escape 1
until 30 Paused
frames 10
click =Leave to title
until 60 =Play
frames 10
